# Toyota Prius XW50 five-door hatchback, 2016-2021.
#
# The fourth-generation Prius. UK order books opened 6 November 2015 and the
# first customer cars were delivered on 1 March 2016; Toyota GB stopped taking
# orders in January 2022. Launch prices £23,295 Active, £24,195 Business
# Edition, £25,995 Business Edition Plus and £27,450 Excel, on the road.
# https://media.toyota.co.uk/new-toyota-prius-uk-range-and-prices-announced/
# https://media.toyota.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/pdf/Prius-Gen4-launch-pack.pdf
#
# Dimensions 4.572 x 1.760 x 1.471 m, wheelbase 2.700 m. Source: English
# Wikipedia, "Toyota Prius (XW50)" infobox (180.0 in x 69.3 in x 57.9 in on a
# 106.3 in wheelbase). The hull measures 4.561 m long, 11 mm short of the
# published figure, and 1.760 m wide, with the wheel centres 2.700 m apart
# (59.1 per cent of length). Mirrors take the modelled width to 1.924 m.
#
# Shape reference: all four photographs are three-quarter views, so the flank
# and the roof line were built from them with the wheel centres fixed by the
# published ratio. The car is the pre-facelift 2016-2018 shape: headlamps that
# sweep to a point over the wing and vertical triangular blades at the lower
# bumper corners. The 2019 facelift is not represented.
#
# Colours are Toyota GB names, evidence grade (a) for the 2018 brochure and
# (b) for the November 2015 launch pack: Galaxy Black, Pure White, Pearl White,
# Hypersonic Red, Galactic Blue, Tyrol Silver and Decuma Grey. Four of them are
# modelled: Tyrol Silver, Pure White, Galactic Blue and Hypersonic Red. Weights
# silver 3, white 3, blue 2, red 2, total 10, provisional pending the central
# rebase.
#
# Speed 180 km/h, the car's quoted maximum. Comfort 115/503, on the line
# 330 + 1.5 x 115: the most refined Prius of the three on the road together
# after 2016. Classes 1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence: March 2016 intro, retires staggered 2028-2031 on a
# twelve- to fifteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/toyota-prius-xw50.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/toyota-prius-xw50.dae (93 objects). References:
# citycars/references/toyota-prius-xw50/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the flank is flatter and the wheel arches less sculpted
# than the photographs; the bonnet V and the bumper contours are shallow; the
# rear bumper is less rounded and the spoiler less pronounced; the roof arc is
# flatter than the real car's. The top view confirms a continuous painted roof
# between the windscreen and the hatch glass. At 128 px the low pointed nose,
# the rising belt line and the vertical tail lamps read as the XW50.

obj=citycar
name=ToyotaPriusXW50(TyrolSilver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=2016
intro_month=3
retire_year=2031
retire_month=6
speed=180
length=3
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=115
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=503

